      "lineage": {
        "description": "Settlement catchment areas were generated by identifying population clusters from gridded datasets, assigning representative points to each cluster, and using Voronoi tessellation to delineate catchment boundaries. Population data from multiple sources (WorldPop, GRID3, Kontur, Meta) were aggregated and disaggregated by sex and age groups. Building counts were derived from OpenStreetMap and Google's machine-learning building detection at varying confidence levels, with average footprint areas calculated per settlement.",
